  "prefLabel": "Env-A 103.01 De minimis emission level",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 103.01 “De minimis emission level” means an uncontrolled emission rate that is in compliance with an associated ambient air limit.\n\nSource. #6739-A, eff 5-8-98; ss and renumbered by #8256, eff 1-14-05 (from Env-A 101.90), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.57), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.58) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
